    {
      "id": "wilde-poetry-spark-s0007-p00009",
      "source_en": "Alas! our children’s sorrow, and their pain\nIn slavery.\n Alas! our warrior sires nobly slain\nFor liberty.\n Alas! our country’s glory, and the name\nOf Troy’s fair town;\nBy the lances and the fighting and the flame\nTall Troy is down.",
